sgp 2

given
  segment OA
    horiz O A
    d1: |OA| = 6
  segment OB
    y_B: y(B) = 4
  segment AB
    |OB| == |AB|

construct
  C = mid(O, A)
  e1 = ellipse(C)
    O == focus(e1)
    B on e1

find
  a1: a(e1)

where
  A (6, 0)
  B (3, 4)
  C (3, 0)
  e1 a 5 b 4 angle 180°
  d1 label (0.3, 0.3)
  y_B label (0.3, 0.3)
  a1 label (0.3, 0.3)
